ly ONE of Gate A / Gate B affects a row -- that's the winner.", "originalText": "Only ONE of Gate A / Gate B affects a row -- that's the winner.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1110, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1111, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "t1112", "x": 800, "y": 484, "width": 1100, "height": 22, "text": "The loser sees 0 rows updated and retries against a fresh query.", "originalText": "The loser sees 0 rows updated and retries against a fresh query.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1113, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1114, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "t1115", "x": 800, "y": 512, "width": 1100, "height": 22, "text": "A mutex in ParkingLot would not have helped -- Gate A and B are separate processes.", "originalText": "A mutex in ParkingLot would not have helped -- Gate A and B are separate processes.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#f87171", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1116, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1117, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}